-- 300 new products across the same 8 categories as V14 -- evenly distributed
-- (see the requesting conversation: testing catalog-scale behavior, not a real business
-- need). Same format as V14, continuing its id range (V14 ended at 57).
-- Category counts: Electronics 38, Home & Kitchen 38, Sports & Outdoors 38, Books 38, Fashion 37, Toys & Games 37, Beauty 37, Office 37 (300 total, ids 58-357).

-- Same fix as V3/V5/V14 -- an explicit-id INSERT never advances product_seq on its own.
SELECT setval('product_seq', (SELECT COALESCE(MAX(id), 1) FROM product));
